.TH API-TEST 1 "2026-02-21" "ShellScript Toolkit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
api-test \- quick API endpoint testing with curl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B api-test
[\fIMETHOD\fR] [\fIURL\fR] [\fIHEADERS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Quick API testing without complex setup.

Shows status code, timing, response body.
Formats JSON responses when detected.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B METHOD
HTTP method: GET (default), POST, PUT, DELETE
.TP
.B URL
Full endpoint URL
.TP
.B HEADERS
Optional headers as "Key: Value"
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B api-test GET https://api.example.com/users
Basic GET test
.TP
.B api-test POST https://api.example.com/users "Authorization: Bearer token"
POST with auth header
.SH OUTPUT
Status code with human-readable meaning
Response time in seconds
First 20 lines of response body
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Fabbio for ShellScript Toolkit Pro
